          "_name": "features004",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Main Title\" name=\"showmainTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ffda00\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Icon Size\" name=\"iconSize\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards BG\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#333333\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#282124\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-semibold mbr-white align-center pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle\">Build Industry</h1>\n\n\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-cards=\"bootstrap\">\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-8\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper media-container-row media-container-row\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-clock\"></span>\n\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title pb-2 mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">7 / 24 ACİL MÜDAHALE</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Dağıtım panoları ve kompanzasyon sistemlerinin tüm elemanlarına yönelik 365 gün 24 saat acil müdahale hizmeti veriyoruz. Ürettiğimiz panoların yüksek kalitede olduğunu taahhüt ediyoruz.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-8 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper media-container-row media-container-row\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-to-local-drive mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title pb-2 mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Modüler Panolar</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Yaptığımız tüm yatırımların ve imalatların Türkiye sanayisine katkı yaptığını bilerek çalışıyoruz. Sadece kendimiz ve müşterilerimiz için değil ülkemiz için de değer üretiyoruz. Yeni ürettiğimiz modüler pano tiplerinde oldukça iddialıyız.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-8\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper media-container-row media-container-row\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-setting\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title pb-2 mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Standart Panolar</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Marka bağımsız, işletmelerinizde yaşamsal süreci devam ettirmek için Harici Tip Panolar, Sıva altı panolar ve Sıva üstü panolar üretiyoruz. CAD-CAM bölümümüz en ince hesapları yaptığında size kusursuz panolar sunuyoruz.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
