          "_name": "content002",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header1\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Number\" name=\"showSubTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Box Color\" name=\"boxbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#efeeee\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#282124\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 img-col\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/hakkimizda2-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"ydpano\" title>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-success\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>READ MORE</a></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-5 title-col align-left\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle || showTitle \">\n                <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n                    <h3 class=\"number mbr-medium mbr-black pb-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">01</h3>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-semibold mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Değerlerimiz</h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7 text-col align-left\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-black mbr-regular mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">- Teknik çizimleri kaliteli ve yeterli projelerle üretmek,<br>- Müşterilerimize kaliteden ödün vermeden tasarrufu da gözeterek uygulanabilir bütçelerde projeler tasarlamak,<br>- Müşterilerimizin istediği sürelerde panoları teslim edebilmek<br>- Ülkemizde ve sektörde ilkleri tasarlayarak uygulayabilmek, \n<br>- Projelerimizde yüksek kaliteden ödün vermeden, son teknolojileri uygulamak&nbsp;<br></p>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "rsRkuVUCi0",
          "_anchor": "content002-n",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
